                        ],
                        "form": "бива́ке"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "d1219e41-607c-4b02-a4c8-4944b3ec1918",
                        "entry_id": "ccca437c-68d1-3833-8e44-96776dabb5ad",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "бива́ках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "40d554e0-fe96-30a9-86f3-efd11eda229e",
                        "entry_id": "ccca437c-68d1-3833-8e44-96776dabb5ad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар., воен. стоянка войск для ночлега или отдыха под открытым небом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "899684aa-516e-4873-b5f5-86e438ff9857",
                                "sense_id": "40d554e0-fe96-30a9-86f3-efd11eda229e",
                                "text": "Но тих был наш бивак открытый // Кто кивер чистил весь избитый, // Кто штык точил, ворча сердито, // Кусая длинный ус."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "422397aa-872e-4fde-b9b7-6bd103247735",
                                "sense_id": "40d554e0-fe96-30a9-86f3-efd11eda229e",
                                "text": "Порою рисовалось моему юношескому воображению зарево биваков, опасное участие в ночном пикете, к которому ветерок доносит жуткий говор неприятеля, жаркая схватка, отважная выручка."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "385969ad-9cea-32db-91d2-057b1e11bf69",
                        "entry_id": "ccca437c-68d1-3833-8e44-96776dabb5ad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "временное месторасположение путешественников"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "982cad07-899b-4e41-87aa-d96d6ca63082",
                                "sense_id": "385969ad-9cea-32db-91d2-057b1e11bf69",
                                "text": "В поле разбили бивак, ужинали с водкой, а потом без музыки танцевали польку-кокетку."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1fdedbed-1aba-45dd-98f5-929f7e435515",
                                "sense_id": "385969ad-9cea-32db-91d2-057b1e11bf69",
                                "text": "Естественно, не стоит злоупотреблять гостеприимством местных жителей ― бивак за собой надо оставить чистым."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "915a3a81-78e0-4462-8fb7-8db5944d3a3a",
                        "source_entry_id": "ccca437c-68d1-3833-8e44-96776dabb5ad",
                        "source_sense_description": "стоянка войск для ночлега или отдыха под открытым небом",
                        "target_lang_word": "bivouac",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bivouac",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b350fc7f-7bbf-3d27-b1da-9673c831ea2a",
                                        "entry_id": "b2f1f0ee-bac2-34c4-a146-7e4bd10caef6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An encampment for the night, usually without tents or covering."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9ba5127-b385-4061-b848-32d2feab65f5",
                                                "sense_id": "b350fc7f-7bbf-3d27-b1da-9673c831ea2a",
                                                "text": "Townsend hare inhabit this area, particularly above the cabin, and a skier is likely to have one explode from a tree well and disappear into the whiteness as he skis by. Life is a constant bivouac for them -- they spend days huddled in tree wells during storms -- but I suspect they are as content and warm in their luxurious coats as we are in a cabin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a38419f-ba50-31d7-ab3d-cef71052b43e",
                                        "entry_id": "b2f1f0ee-bac2-34c4-a146-7e4bd10caef6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any temporary encampment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a292f78-21a0-3c92-ba59-0b7a1bdccd8f",
                                        "entry_id": "b2f1f0ee-bac2-34c4-a146-7e4bd10caef6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A temporary shelter constructed generally for a few nights."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2ed5764-63cd-4d27-acf2-d238323d7353",
                                                "sense_id": "4a292f78-21a0-3c92-ba59-0b7a1bdccd8f",
                                                "text": "Behold the Mansion reared by Dædal Jack!\nSee the Malt stored in many a plethoric sack,\nIn the proud cirque of Juan's bivouac!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d4a9261-d765-48ce-852b-b6bddbe63cd2",
                                                "sense_id": "4a292f78-21a0-3c92-ba59-0b7a1bdccd8f",
                                                "text": "The outing begins by Thursday noon, when the recreational vehicles start rumbling into town and their owners set up bivouacs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0825292c-c946-3055-a919-fe3a9835ee9e",
                                        "entry_id": "b2f1f0ee-bac2-34c4-a146-7e4bd10caef6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The watch of a whole army by night, when in danger of surprise or attack."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06b00bb6-5220-386e-9e6e-75ad759001f1",
                                        "entry_id": "b2f1f0ee-bac2-34c4-a146-7e4bd10caef6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A structure formed by migratory ants out of their own bodies to protect the queen and larvae."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "bivouac",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "753ee1c2-0613-363e-9fe3-4c637541a7a9",
                                        "entry_id": "3fe88b26-505a-340a-9727-93b16f140479",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To set up camp."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07ffa324-a17d-4758-a272-fe72115c09ba",
                                                "sense_id": "753ee1c2-0613-363e-9fe3-4c637541a7a9",
                                                "text": "We'll bivouac here tonight."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ac055a6-0db8-4ce3-be66-e167d67d159f",
                                                "sense_id": "753ee1c2-0613-363e-9fe3-4c637541a7a9",
                                                "text": "They reached the fir wood which had caused them so much trouble while it was still daylight, and bivouacked in a hollow just above it. It was tedious gathering the fire wood; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a1ef0890-9af3-32a2-8316-e9424b54a7f7",
                                        "entry_id": "3fe88b26-505a-340a-9727-93b16f140479",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To watch at night or be on guard, as a whole army."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a7aed69-a40f-3be7-824a-ddfabd4309a5",
                                        "entry_id": "3fe88b26-505a-340a-9727-93b16f140479",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To encamp for the night without tents or covering."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ac0a5147-5155-4363-9b1d-4597ae008f89",
                        "source_entry_id": "ccca437c-68d1-3833-8e44-96776dabb5ad",
                        "source_sense_description": "стоянка войск для ночлега или отдыха под открытым небом",
                        "target_lang_word": "Biwak",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Biwak",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "77fc6576-4f4b-37dc-93ca-f05450d2fdcb",
                                        "entry_id": "d520917e-a30c-351d-9231-6f18699ad08c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lager im Freien, in Hütten oder Zelten (vor allem von Soldaten oder Bergsteigern)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09c47593-50df-4cad-a84b-f9b88680038e",
                                                "sense_id": "77fc6576-4f4b-37dc-93ca-f05450d2fdcb",
                                                "text": "Sie mussten ihr Biwak wegen des Wetters früher als geplant aufschlagen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "faf010a0-a24b-4fc5-8d8a-a2173bfae8a7",
                                                "sense_id": "77fc6576-4f4b-37dc-93ca-f05450d2fdcb",
                                                "text": "„Abends schlugen sie unweit der Gräber ihr Biwak auf.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "822a84b6-b29e-4b00-b551-fa883eff6a64",
                                                "sense_id": "77fc6576-4f4b-37dc-93ca-f05450d2fdcb",
                                                "text": "„Er liess sich sein Pferd satteln und ritt vom Biwak seines Regiments aus zum väterlichen Gut, auf welchem er geboren war und seine Kindheit verlebt hatte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
